  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On Huo Tan mountain, a necessary stop on the road to San Cha Mountain, Meng Tu and Jiao Huang wait in an insignificant corner over a trap they spent several days preparing for Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing. When Meng Tu brings up Xiao Fu Lu while urging his partner not to fear the targets, Jiao Huang frowns, says he has told Meng Tu many times not to talk about Xiao Fu Lu, and orders the matter kept in Meng Tu’s stomach and never mentioned again. He names Xiao Fu Lu the grandson of Xiao clan’s supreme elder and says killing him offended a Gu Immortal. Meng Tu answers that they have lived free and safe for years since then.",
      "chapters": [
        335
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
